--v2.0.0a20
+ Python 3.12 or later, removes Python 2 compatibility, and builds with uv.
+ Ships as cp312-abi3 wheels for Linux, macOS and Windows on x86_64 and arm64, plus a pure-Python fallback wheel.
+ Container metadata can now also be stored as HDT for accelerated loading and RDF scaling.
+ Fixes double open of ZIP containers on load.
+ Rdflib 7 replaces the custom RDF model.
+ API changes in ways that break 0.x code - see the README for a summary.
+ The aff4 cli adds an ls [-l] command for exploring logical images.
--v.037
+ HDT support for RDF infomodel
+ Use rdflib as datastore, rather than parallel RDF store
+ Upgrade to recent rdflib
--v0.36
+ Remove python2 backwards compatibility
+ Refactor out hash-based logical imaging to separate class
+ Make fastchunking dependency optional - only needed for hash-based logical imaging
--v0.33
+ Fix performance regressions.
+ Make logging more efficient.
+ Remove invalid unit test.
--v0.32
+ Fix bug in reference counting
+ Tune lower encryption container for efficiency
+ Improve logging
-- v0.31
+ Support for encrypted image streams.
+ Enable abort of single logical file acqusitions before close, reclaiming space.
+ Random IO image stream.
-- v0.30
+ In-progress support for encrypted image streams.
-- v0.29
+ Fix double load of RDF
-- v0.28
+ Replace dependency pyblake2 with pynacl (Apache Licence)
+ Add another sample - simple_block_read.py
+ Fix invalid dateTime RDF
